}}</ref>

A 1979 feature in the ''[[San Francisco Chronicle]]'' referred to Ralston as a “World martial arts champion” and described him teaching at his Cheng Hsin academy in Oakland.<ref name="chronicle1979">{{cite news
 |last=Rapoport
 |first=Roger
 |title=Parrying the Martial Arts Ripoff
