A 1982 article in ''Parade'' described Ralston as a San Francisco native and reported details about his age, height, weight, and participation in the tournament. It compared the event with the fictional martial arts contest depicted in [[Bruce Lee]]'s ''[[Enter the Dragon]]''.<ref name="significa">{{cite news
